# Daily.co & image.pngRecording Security

- Dynamic Meeting Tokens:
  - Meeting tokens must be time-boxed dynamically to the lesson schedule:
    * `nbf` (Not Before): `scheduledAt` minus 10 minutes.
    * `exp` (Expiration): `scheduledAt` + `durationMinutes` + 10% grace buffer (no rigid 2-hour cap to support 60/120/180 min lessons).
- Tutor vs Student Permissions:
  - Tutor / Manager / Admin token: `is_owner: true` (screen sharing, auto cloud recording).
  - Student token: `is_owner: false` (join-only participant).
- Recording Privacy:
  - Video recordings must NEVER be publicly accessible.
  - Access is granted exclusively via short-lived Presigned URLs (maximum 2-hour TTL).